; Home — the riverbank at the end of the journey. GENERATED by
; tools/gen_home.py; edit that, not this. GDD §3 Act 5, §3a Act 5, §8
; Scene F.
;
; PLACEHOLDER: primitives, the street's procedural textures and CC0 trees
; (docs/RIGHTS_REGISTER.md). Replaced by the painted bank of GDD §10.
; Palette: GDD §10, Grove row, rose-gold dusk, without its magenta sky by
; decision (docs/DECISIONS.md "Remembrance and Home"). Krishna's indigo
; is allowed here and is the panel's to review.

